erish</span><span begin="00:55.970" end="00:56.030"> my</span><span begin="00:56.070" end="00:56.940"> love</span><span begin="00:57.000" end="00:57.140"> (my</span><span begin="00:57.200" end="00:57.870"> love)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.870" end="01:00.580"><span begin="00:57.870" end="00:58.350">어차피</span><span begin="00:58.430" end="00:58.530"> 넌</span><span begin="00:58.550" end="00:58.620"> 내</span><span begin="00:58.790" end="00:58.980"> 게,</span><span begin="00:59.090" end="00:59.170"> 내</span><span begin="00:59.340" end="00:59.470"> 게</span><span begin="00:59.580" end="01:00.580"> 분명</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.580" end="01:04.100"><span begin="01:00.580" end="01:00.770">날</span><span begin="01:01.050" end="01:01.370"> 말릴</span><span begin="01:01.620" end="01:02.150"> 순</span><span begin="01:02.610" end="01:04.100"> 없을걸</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.100" end="01:08.340"><span begin="01:04.100" end="01:04.400">하느님도</span><span begin="01:04.500" end="01:04.640"> 두</span><span begin="01:04.750" end="01:04.830"> 손</span><span begin="01:05.000" end="01:05.090"> 두</span><span begin="01:05.290" end="01:05.380"> 발</span><span begin="01:05.420" end="01:05.930"> 들었지,</span><span begin="01:06.110" end="01:06.380"> 좋아해</span><span begin="01:06.440" end="01:06.820"> 'cause</span><span begin="01:06.970" end="01:07.150"> I</span><span begin="01:07.190" end="01:08.340"> wanna</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.340" end="01:11.700"><span begin="01:08.340" end="01:08.460">너란</span><span begin="01:08.600" end="01:08.990"> 아이는</span><span begin="01:09.240" end="01:09.500"> make</span><span begin="01:09.670" end="01:09.800"> me</span><span begin="01:09.840" end="01:10.420"> higher,</span><span begin="01:10.690" end="01:10.730"> 널</span><span begin="01:10.800" end="01:11.700"> 웃기면</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.700" end="01:15.170"><span begin="01:11.700" end="01:12.600">웃을까?</span><span begin="01:12.640" end="01:13.770"> 어떨까